            "stars_number": 5,
            "stars_alignment": "start",
            "stars_mobilealignment": "start",
            "review_text": "The Cozy Cave is a win-win for both me and my pets. It’s such a relief to see them sleep soundly in their little sanctuary. The materials feel premium, and the foldable design is genius for weekend getaways. Keeping it clean is a breeze, thanks to the removable cover. Totally worth every penny!",
