            "stars_size": "sm",
            "stars_color": "#facc15",
            "stars_number": 5,
            "stars_alignment": "start",
            "stars_mobilealignment": "start",
            "review_text": "I was initially skeptical about the whole foldable thing but omg it’s a game changer! We travel a lot, and this bed is super easy to pack. My schnauzer, Max, and my two cats took to it right away. It looks great in my living room, doesn’t clutter like others did. Plus, keeping it clean couldn't be easier! It actually encourages Max to snuggle more since he feels safe. This pet bed is beyond convenient and the quality is just amazing. A must-have in every pet household, honestly can’t imagine life without it anymore!",
